# Finance Tracker

## Context
Personal project for my application to a CFC apprenticeship (IT specialist,
application development). I must be able to explain every part of the code
in an interview.

## Rules
- Only HTML, CSS and simple JavaScript, with no framework and no server.
- Explain what you change after each modification, in simple terms.
- No em dashes in any text.
- Data stays in the browser (localStorage).

## Design
- Colors and spacing are defined in the :root variables (style.css).
- Clean, simple style, readable on phone and on desktop.
